PARITY MAPPING (web -> native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  data:   useSignalObservations(vehicleId,{signal_name,limit:1}) x5 cold signals
            (PowershareStatus/Type/StopReason/HoursLeft/InstantaneousPowerKW; latestText/
            latestNumeric)                                                              ->
          PowershareSource seam (P1/S8) pushing a coalesced PowershareUpdate of
            PowershareSignals(status/shareType/stopReason/hoursLeft/powerKw); bound through
            @Observable PowersharePageModel. No HTTP in the view. (ADR-004)
  helper: statusVariant(status)      -> PowershareProjection.statusTone(_:)   (verbatim
            substring order incl. the "inactive"->success quirk — pinned by test+self-test)
          stopReasonVariant(reason)  -> PowershareProjection.stopReasonTone(_:)
          hasData                    -> PowershareProjection.hasData(_:)  (!= nil semantics)
          fmtNumber(v,2)+'kW' / (v,1)+'h' -> PowershareProjection.tiles(_:locale:)
            (NumberFormatter .decimal, grouping, halfUp == toLocaleString; safeNumber->0)
  shell:  <PageContainer title subtitle actions={<VehicleSelect/>}>  -> ScrollView header
            (TSPageTitle + token subtitle + optional vehicle-context label) + toolbar
            (freshness chip + refresh); adaptive macOS/iOS (ADR-002/006)
  panel1: <FadeIn><GlassPanel> Zap + t('statusSection') + <Badge variant>{status}|noData> +
            (hasData? <Grid 3x StatCard> : <EmptyState noData>) </GlassPanel></FadeIn>     ->
            PowershareStatusPanel: TSFadeIn + TSGlassPanel + bolt.fill(statusWarning) +
            TSPanelTitle + status badge + (PowershareStatsGrid | TSEmptyState noData)
  panel5: <FadeIn delay.05><GlassPanel> AlertCircle + t('stopReasonSection') +
            (stopReason? <Badge>{reason}</Badge>+help : <EmptyState noStopReason>)          ->
            PowershareStopReasonPanel: TSFadeIn(0.05) + TSGlassPanel +
            exclamationmark.circle.fill(statusDanger) + TSPanelTitle + (value badge + help |
            TSEmptyState noStopReason)
  badge:  <Badge variant={statusVariant}>{dynamic}</Badge>  -> PowershareValueBadge (verbatim
            value, tone color from token) — the neutral no-status case uses TSBadge(common.noData)
  states: web implicit empty/success widened to loading/content/error (ADR-011) so no region
            is ever blank: PowsharePhase {loading->skeleton, error->retry, content->data|empty}
  live:   signal stream freshness >2min -> PowersharePageModel.resolveStale +
            PowershareFreshnessChip (ADR-013)
  i18n:   13 powershare.* + common.noData web keys, verbatim, resolved from
            Localizable.xcstrings via PowershareStrings (ADR-014)
  a11y:   per-tile combined label/value; panel containers .accessibilityElement(.contain);
            SF Symbols accessibilityHidden; Dynamic Type via Font.TS; light/dark/high-contrast
            via the generated dynamic-color tokens; >=44pt controls (ADR-015)
  units:  formatted only at the display boundary (Adapter), never stored/computed non-SI;
            'kW'/'h'/'—' are the web's literal unit/empty glyphs (not i18n in the web either)

